From a3ae77c584ad181be6654be8670c2f6df1e86457 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 23:05:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 245/270] tegra_dc.accelerant: overlay hooks

One overlay channel for B_YCbCr422 and B_RGB32 buffers, with color
keying and horizontal and vertical filtering. The window is clipped to
the screen and the view follows the clipping.

Signed-off-by: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
